* B-052: EVLSRC positional argument is the values file (it was silently ignored,
* only the initial 0 was emitted). File format (EVLSource::setValues): one
* `time,voltage` row per line, SI units (s, V). The first line of the file is
* always discarded (B-053), hence the header line in the file.
* Expected emissions: @0 s 0 (initial 0 at enable), @100 ps 1.5, @200 ps -0.5,
* @300 ps 0. (The W571 "no activity" warning of the .op step is expected: nothing
* optical in the circuit.)
evlsrc1 e "tests/golden/netlists/b052-evlsrc-values.csv"
.tran 1e-9
